==Battleground==
*1 [[Coffin Zoge]] spawns.
*1 [[Lord Gravey]] spawns.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Due to the enemy limit being only 2, the Assassin Bear will only spawn once one of the first 2 enemies has been killed. This makes the stage as simple as using fast meatshields to keep the enemy from advancing too far, as well as any unit that can [[Knockback]] Zombies. As both aren't set as bosses, they can be knocked behind the base while other attackers destroy it. [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]], [[Sniper the Recruit (Super Rare Cat)|Sniper the Deadeye]], [[Cat God the Great (Special Cat)|Cat God the Awesome]], [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Awakened Ururun]], [[Nekoluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Ultralan Pasalan]], and [[Kubiluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Kubilan Pasalan]] are good choices as they'll knock back and possibly kill Coffin Zoge, but won't be able to finish it off.

Never use any unit with Zombie Killer, as they will simply allow the overbuffed Assassin Bear to spawn.

